WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Find the past simple of go, a very common irregular verb.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:15.500
“goed” adds -ed to an irregular verb. “gone” is the participle: it goes with have, as in “I have gone”.

3
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.500
go → went: “Yesterday I went to work.”
